description:
Join rangers and volunteers for a fun exciting day out on our regional parks!&nbsp;
Bring your family and friends to help plant trees and keep Auckland green.&nbsp;
We'll meet you and take you to the planting site.
Wear sturdy enclosed boots or shoes and weather appropriate clothes - planting will happen even if it rains.
If you have a spade and gloves, bring them along or we'll provide them.&nbsp;
Bring along your water bottles. We'll provide food at the end of the planting.&nbsp;
Protect our parks from kauri dieback, bring only clean footwear and equipment to our parks.
